  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nBy using BODMAS rule,\n\n**OPTION 1)**\n\n230 × **1 ÷ 5** + 16 - 41 = 21\n\n**230 × 0.2** + 16 - 41= 21\n\n**46 + 16** - 41 = 21\n\n**62 - 41** = 21\n\n21 = 21\n\n**Therefore, LHS is equal to RHS**\n\nOPTION 2)\n\n230 + **1 ÷ 5** × 16 - 41 = 21\n\nSOLVING LHS:\n\n230 + **0.2 ×16** - 41\n\n**230 + 3.2 **- 41\n\n**233.2 - 42**\n\n192.2\n\nThus, LHS is not equal to RHS.\n\nOPTION3)\n\n230 – 1 + **5 ÷ 16** × 41 = 21\n\nSOLVING LHS,\n\n230 - 1 + **0.3125 × 41**\n\n**230** - 1 **+ 12.8**\n\n**230 - 13.8**\n\n216.2\n\nThus, LHS is not equal to RHS.\n\nOPTION4)\n\n**230 ÷ 1** + 5 – 16 × 41 = 21\n\nSolving LHS\n\n230 + 5 - **16 × 41**\n\n**230 + 5** - 656\n\n**235 - 656**\n\n- 421\n\nThus, LHS is not equal to RHS\"\n\nHence, **\"****×, ÷, +, –, =\" **is the correct answer.",
